    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NDE Near Dungeon Experience - A retro SNES styled turn-based RPG/Survival game.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 7 Dungeons, as you ascend upwards towards the truth of where you are and who you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reclaim your memories, fight or avoid enemies, solve puzzles, collect treasure, trade with and be Guided by... Guide, a mysterious spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn skills  and figure out what strategies work best for each enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find tools to access new areas of each dungeon, you can climb, dig, jump, light your way and find previously inaccessible areas...and an Easter Egg or two.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the SIN SYSTEM your stats are altered according to your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, being an SNES inspired game, there are NO AUTO-Saves, so save save save.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ADDITIONAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 4 modes of gameplay; Fighter (EASY), Loner (NORMAL), Scholar (HARD) and Ecto (NIGHTMARE)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each with their own gears, shops, enemies and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A playthrough of ALL MODES is approximately 11 Hours... for me...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilizes RPG Maker VX Ace, so naturally the focus was to create a game as NON-Vanilla as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the Music and graphics are original.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NDE Near Dungeon Experience - A retro SNES styled turn-based RPG/Survival game.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 7 Dungeons, as you ascend upwards towards the truth of where you are and who you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reclaim your memories, fight or avoid enemies, solve puzzles, collect treasure, trade with and be Guided by... Guide, a mysterious spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn skills  and figure out what strategies work best for each enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find tools to access new areas of each dungeon, you can climb, dig, jump, light your way and find previously inaccessible areas...and an Easter Egg or two.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the SIN SYSTEM your stats are altered according to your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, being an SNES inspired game, there are NO AUTO-Saves, so save save save.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ADDITIONAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 4 modes of gameplay; Fighter (EASY), Loner (NORMAL), Scholar (HARD) and Ecto (NIGHTMARE)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each with their own gears, shops, enemies and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A playthrough of ALL MODES is approximately 11 Hours... for me...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilizes RPG Maker VX Ace, so naturally the focus was to create a game as NON-Vanilla as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the Music and graphics are original.</p>",
    "short_description": "A dark turn-based RPG. A survival game where you must conserve and plan accordingly. You must solve puzzles, collect memories and make decisions as a part of the sin system. Collect tools to aid in your traversal of each dungeon. Develop strategies to take down each enemy.",
